# Conjuration spell names + descriptions.
spell-find_steed = Find Steed
spell-find_steed-desc = You call forth a faithful spirit that takes the shape of a swift and intelligent mount, forging a lasting bond between you. The steed appears in an open space nearby, ready to serve and bear you into battle or across long roads.
spell-flock_of_familiars = Flock of Familiars
spell-flock_of_familiars-desc = You call forth three minor spirits that settle into small animal shapes of their choosing. Each bonded companion can scout, fetch, and relay what it senses back to you.
spell-healing_spirit = Healing Spirit
spell-healing_spirit-desc = A gentle nature spirit takes form in a small space you designate, drifting at your command through the fray. It lingers near the wounded, offering what quiet comfort its fading presence can lend.
spell-helpful_homunculi = Helpful Homunculi
spell-helpful_homunculi-desc = You call forth a flock of intangible, invulnerable helper spirits that take the shape of tiny constructs and assist with tasks at your direction. They linger near you, lending their many small hands for the spell's duration.
spell-homunculus_servant = Homunculus Servant
spell-homunculus_servant-desc = You knit together a tiny artificial helper that obeys your will and acts on your behalf. The construct persists as a loyal companion, sharing in your magic.
spell-summon_beast = Summon Beast
spell-summon_beast-desc = You call a fierce spirit into a beastlike body that springs from empty air nearby. The conjured creature obeys you and battles at your side until the binding fades.
spell-conjure_animals = Conjure Animals
spell-conjure_animals-desc = You call wild spirits that take on the shapes of beasts, materializing in open spaces nearby to fight at your side. The summoned creatures persist while you keep your focus.
spell-conjure_constructs = Conjure Constructs
spell-conjure_constructs-desc = You call forth a cluster of orderly, half-real spirits that take the shape of mechanical figures in an open space nearby. They persist while you concentrate, striking at foes you direct them against.
spell-conjured_viper = Conjured Viper
spell-conjured_viper-desc = A coiling serpent of pale, woven light wraps around you, lending its borrowed vitality as a shimmering ward. The protection fades the moment that conjured resilience is fully spent.
spell-create_bonfire = Create Bonfire
spell-create_bonfire-desc = You conjure a small pillar of magical flame on a patch of ground you can see, scorching any creature caught in its space.
spell-infestation = Infestation
spell-infestation-desc = A swarm of biting mites and parasites materializes for an instant upon a target you can see, gnawing at it with venomous bites.
spell-produce_flame = Produce Flame
spell-produce_flame-desc = A small flame springs to life in your palm and can be flung at a foe as a searing bolt, winking out once thrown.
spell-sword_burst = Sword Burst
spell-sword_burst-desc = A ring of conjured blades flickers into being and whirls outward, slashing every nearby foe in a single sweep.
spell-ensnaring_strike = Ensnaring Strike
spell-ensnaring_strike-desc = You strike a foe as thorned vines erupt from the wound, grasping at the target and holding it fast.
spell-entangle = Entangle
spell-entangle-desc = Snarling vines and creepers erupt from the soil across a chosen patch of ground, clutching at the legs of any who try to cross it.
spell-find_familiar = Find Familiar
spell-find_familiar-desc = You bind a willing spirit that manifests as a small animal of your choosing, serving as a loyal companion and your eyes and ears. The bonded creature obeys your commands and fights at your side for as long as the bond holds.
spell-fog_cloud = Fog Cloud
spell-fog_cloud-desc = A dense bank of mist billows out from a chosen point, swelling to fill the surrounding space. Anyone within is wrapped in a blinding gray haze.
spell-goodberry = Goodberry
spell-goodberry-desc = A cluster of softly glowing berries forms in your palm, each one swollen with restorative life, mending small wounds of those nearby who share in it.
spell-grease = Grease
spell-grease-desc = A sheet of slippery grease floods a small patch of ground, leaving the footing treacherous for anyone caught on it.
spell-hail_of_thorns = Hail of Thorns
spell-hail_of_thorns-desc = Living briars wreathe your next weapon strike, tearing into the target with a burst of piercing growth.
spell-ice_knife = Ice Knife
spell-ice_knife-desc = You conjure a sliver of jagged ice and hurl it at a foe, the shard splitting on impact to spray freezing fragments at those nearby.
spell-unseen_servant = Unseen Servant
spell-unseen_servant-desc = You conjure a faint, invisible force that obeys your spoken commands within range. The mindless servant has no will of its own and dissolves when the magic fades or it is struck.
spell-withering_tendrils = Withering Tendrils
spell-withering_tendrils-desc = Ribbons of devouring shadow burst outward from your body, lashing every creature near you with hungry, withering energy.
spell-cloud_of_daggers = Cloud of Daggers
spell-cloud_of_daggers-desc = A whirling mass of conjured blades fills the air around a chosen point, slicing apart anything that enters or lingers within.
spell-dust_devil = Dust Devil
spell-dust_devil-desc = A churning vortex of grit and wind springs up at a point you choose, battering nearby foes and flinging them aside.
spell-flaming_sphere = Flaming Sphere
spell-flaming_sphere-desc = A rolling orb of living flame springs into being, scorching any creature that strays too close to its heat.
spell-web = Web
spell-web-desc = A dense lattice of clinging strands spins across a chosen volume, snaring anyone caught within and choking their movement.
spell-call_lightning = Call Lightning
spell-call_lightning-desc = You summon a churning storm cloud overhead and draw a searing bolt of lightning down onto a chosen point, scorching everyone near the strike.
spell-hunger_of_hadar = Hunger of Hadar
spell-hunger_of_hadar-desc = A tear in space spills a sphere of starless void and biting cold, gnawing at everything caught within and leaving victims groping blindly through the smothering dark.
spell-sleet_storm = Sleet Storm
spell-sleet_storm-desc = A churning column of freezing rain and sleet pours down over a wide area, blinding those caught within and coating the ground in treacherous ice.
spell-spirit_guardians = Spirit Guardians
spell-spirit_guardians-desc = Summoned spirits wheel and flit around you, lashing at any foe that draws near and sapping their strength.
spell-stinking_cloud = Stinking Cloud
spell-stinking_cloud-desc = A churning sphere of foul yellow vapor erupts at a chosen point, seeping around corners and leaving everyone caught within sick and reeling.
spell-tidal_wave = Tidal Wave
spell-tidal_wave-desc = A surging crest of conjured water rises and slams down across a stretch of ground, battering those caught beneath it and sweeping them off their feet.

spell-misty_step = Misty Step
spell-misty_step-desc = Veiled for an instant in a curl of pale mist, you vanish and reappear in an open spot within short range, slipping past any who would bar your way.
spell-vortex_warp = Vortex Warp
spell-vortex_warp-desc = You tear open a folded seam in the space around you and step through it, arriving at any open spot you can see within a much greater range than a simple blink allows, though the working takes a full breath to complete.
spell-thunder_step = Thunder Step
spell-thunder_step-desc = The air folds shut behind you as you vanish and reappear at a visible point within range. Onlookers swear they hear a distant peal of thunder, though nothing about the arrival itself does any harm.
spell-spray_of_cards = Spray of Cards
spell-spray_of_cards-desc = You fan out a hand of razor-edged spectral cards that scatter in a wide cone before you, slashing anyone caught in the spray and leaving them squinting through a flurry of glinting steel.
spell-conjure_barrage = Conjure Barrage
spell-conjure_barrage-desc = Hurling a single thrown weapon skyward, you conjure a sweeping spray of identical phantom copies that hammer everything caught in a wide cone before vanishing.
spell-the_folded_tower = the Folded Tower
spell-the_folded_tower-desc = You call forth a ring of humming, translucent stone from open ground, rising into a rough fortification around a chosen spot -- cover enough to make a stand behind, if not the elder Galvane's full two-story keep of legend.
spell-summon_fey = Summon Fey
spell-summon_fey-desc = A capricious wildland spirit answers your call, taking shape in a clear space nearby. It fights at your side and obeys your commands for as long as your focus holds.
spell-summon_lesser_demons = Summon Lesser Demons
spell-summon_lesser_demons-desc = Speaking corrupted syllables, you tear open a rift to the churning chaos beyond, dragging a small pack of minor fiends into the world to fight at your command for as long as your focus holds.
spell-summon_shadowspawn = Summon Shadowspawn
spell-summon_shadowspawn-desc = You knit gloom into a corporeal shade that takes form in an open space nearby, fighting at your command for as long as your focus holds.
spell-black_tentacles = Black Tentacles
spell-black_tentacles-desc = A writhing mass of dark, grasping tendrils erupts across a patch of ground you can see, crushing and ensnaring anything caught within its reach.
spell-conjure_minor_elementals = Conjure Minor Elementals
spell-conjure_minor_elementals-desc = The caster calls forth a band of lesser elemental spirits, which take shape in open ground nearby. The summoner picks the form the gathering takes, binding the spirits to fight at their side.
spell-conjure_woodland_beings = Conjure Woodland Beings
spell-conjure_woodland_beings-desc = Whistling an old woodland call, the caster draws shy fey spirits out of the wilds to stand at their side. The summoned beings linger and fight on the caster's behalf for as long as their focus holds.
spell-dimension_door = Dimension Door
spell-dimension_door-desc = The caster folds the space between two points and steps instantly to a chosen location within range, even one merely pictured or described.
spell-doomtide = Doomtide
spell-doomtide-desc = A churning sphere of inky, magical mist wells up at a chosen point, swallowing all light and gnawing at the minds of anyone caught within its burst.
spell-faithful_hound = Faithful Hound
spell-faithful_hound-desc = You call forth a spectral guardian beast that keeps watch over a chosen spot. It barks an alarm at hidden intruders and lunges to bite any foe that draws too near.
spell-find_greater_steed = Find Greater Steed
spell-find_greater_steed-desc = You call forth a noble spirit that condenses into a powerful, intelligent mount bound to your will. The creature appears in a clear space nearby, ready to bear you swiftly into battle or across great distances.
spell-giant_insect = Giant Insect
spell-giant_insect-desc = You call forth an enormous insect — a towering centipede, spider, or wasp — that surges into being at a spot you can see. The creature heeds your will and fights at your side until your focus wavers.
spell-grasping_vine = Grasping Vine
spell-grasping_vine-desc = A thick, living vine erupts from the earth at a spot you choose and whips out to snare a nearby foe, yanking it sharply toward the creeping growth.
spell-guardian_of_faith = Guardian of Faith
spell-guardian_of_faith-desc = A towering luminous sentinel materializes in a space you choose nearby, standing watch over the area. Any hostile creature that draws too close is seared by a lance of holy light until the guardian's borrowed power is spent.
spell-summon_aberration = Summon Aberration
spell-summon_aberration-desc = The caster tears a sliver of the warped beyond into reality, where it coils into a slithering aberrant servant. The summoned horror obeys its conjurer and unravels nearby foes until the binding lapses.
spell-summon_construct = Summon Construct
spell-summon_construct-desc = You bind a roaming spirit into a body of metal and stone, raising an animated guardian in a clear space nearby. The construct obeys your will and fights for you until the binding fades.
spell-summon_elemental = Summon Elemental
spell-summon_elemental-desc = The caster calls a raw elemental spirit into being at a nearby spot, shaping it from fire, water, earth, or air. The summoned creature fights at the caster's command while the binding holds.
spell-summon_greater_demon = Summon Greater Demon
spell-summon_greater_demon-desc = Speaking words of corruption, the caster tears open a rift and drags forth a powerful fiend bound to serve until the caster's focus fades.
spell-watery_sphere = Watery Sphere
spell-watery_sphere-desc = You summon a hovering globe of churning water that sweeps up and batters any creature it touches, hurling those caught within it aside.
spell-banishing_smite = Banishing Smite
spell-banishing_smite-desc = You wreathe your weapon in radiant exile-force, so your next strike deals extra force damage.
spell-cloudkill = Cloudkill
spell-cloudkill-desc = A churning sphere of sickly yellow-green vapor billows into being, seeping around corners and sinking into any low ground. Every creature caught within chokes on a burst of toxic poison damage.
spell-conjure_elemental = Conjure Elemental
spell-conjure_elemental-desc = The caster pulls a being of raw air, earth, fire, or water out of its native realm to serve as a bound ally until the binding falters.
spell-conjure_volley = Conjure Volley
spell-conjure_volley-desc = By loosing a single mundane shot or hurled blade skyward, the caster multiplies it into a storm of conjured projectiles that rains down over a chosen patch of ground. Every creature caught beneath the deluge must dodge or be riddled.
spell-far_step = Far Step
spell-far_step-desc = The caster folds space to flicker to a visible empty spot up to eighteen meters away. While the magic holds, a quick exertion of will lets them blink across that distance again each turn.
spell-infernal_calling = Infernal Calling
spell-infernal_calling-desc = You chant a binding incantation that tears a fiend up from the burning depths to serve at your command. The summoned creature obeys you while your focus holds, but strains against the binding whenever your concentration wavers.
spell-insect_plague = Insect Plague
spell-insect_plague-desc = A roiling swarm of biting locusts boils up to fill a wide sphere, tearing at every creature trapped within.
spell-steel_wind_strike = Steel Wind Strike
spell-steel_wind_strike-desc = The caster dissolves into a rushing gust and lashes out at up to five chosen foes within reach, each blow landing as a separate weapon-charged hit of crackling force.
spell-summon_celestial = Summon Celestial
spell-summon_celestial-desc = You call down a radiant celestial spirit that takes shining, winged form in a space you can see nearby. The spirit fights at your command and lends its holy light to your allies for as long as you hold your focus.
spell-summon_draconic_spirit = Summon Draconic Spirit
spell-summon_draconic_spirit-desc = You weave arcane power to call a winged drake-spirit into being at a point you can see nearby. The conjured ally fights at your command, breathing elemental force and tearing at foes until your concentration fails.
spell-summon_dragon = Summon Dragon
spell-summon_dragon-desc = You weave a pact of scale and ember, calling a draconic spirit into being at a spot you can see nearby. It serves as your ally, striking and shielding at your direction until the binding fades.
spell-teleportation_circle = Teleportation Circle
spell-teleportation_circle-desc = You trace a glowing ring of bound sigils on the ground and step through, arriving instantly at a distant marked site you have memorized.
spell-tree_stride = Tree Stride
spell-tree_stride-desc = By touching a living tree the caster melts into its trunk and reappears from another tree of the same kind nearby, stepping through the forest's hidden roots. While the bond holds, each tree becomes a doorway to its kin.
spell-arcane_gate = Arcane Gate
spell-arcane_gate-desc = The caster tears open a shimmering rift in space and steps through it, arriving at a chosen point within reach.
spell-conjure_fey = Conjure Fey
spell-conjure_fey-desc = You tear open a brief seam to the wild courts, calling forth a fey ally that fights alongside you. The summoned spirit obeys your commands until your focus breaks.
spell-heroes_feast = Heroes Feast
spell-heroes_feast-desc = You summon a lavish banquet whose blessed dishes restore vitality and fortify all who partake.
spell-planar_ally = Planar Ally
spell-planar_ally-desc = The caster calls out across the planes to a cosmic patron they revere, pleading for its intervention. A servant of that power answers, willing to lend its strength in exchange for a fitting boon.
spell-scatter = Scatter
spell-scatter-desc = The air shudders around you, wrenching you through a brief seam in space to another spot you choose within sight.
spell-summon_fiend = Summon Fiend
spell-summon_fiend-desc = You tear open a brief rift and bind a malevolent spirit into a physical shape that fights at your command. The bound horror endures so long as you hold your focus on the breach.
spell-transport_via_plants = Transport via Plants
spell-transport_via_plants-desc = The caster weaves a living gateway between a large rooted plant nearby and another distant plant they have touched or seen, then steps through the verdant passage themselves.
spell-wall_of_thorns = Wall of Thorns
spell-wall_of_thorns-desc = A dense barrier of tangled, needle-sharp briar erupts from the ground, raking any creature that tries to push through it. The thorny wall blocks passage and tears at those who force their way across.
spell-word_of_recall = Word of Recall
spell-word_of_recall-desc = With a single uttered command, you are whisked across any distance to a sanctuary you consecrated beforehand, reappearing in the closest open space within the haven.
spell-conjure_celestial = Conjure Celestial
spell-conjure_celestial-desc = You call a radiant spirit of the higher planes into being at a point you can see, where it fights at your side and lends its blessed aid until your focus wanes.
spell-dream_of_the_blue_veil = Dream of the Blue Veil
spell-dream_of_the_blue_veil-desc = The caster slips through a brief fold in the veil between worlds and reappears at a chosen point within reach.
spell-etherealness = Etherealness
spell-etherealness-desc = You slip sideways into the thin overlap between this world and the spectral expanse for the span of a single step, reappearing at a nearby point unseen and unheard.
spell-plane_shift = Plane Shift
spell-plane_shift-desc = The caster is torn from one point in reality and deposited at another, aimed only in broad strokes, never with pinpoint certainty.
spell-teleport = Teleport
spell-teleport-desc = Folding the space between two distant points, the caster blinks out of existence and reappears at a place fixed in mind, with less familiar destinations risking an imperfect arrival.
spell-temple_of_the_gods = Temple of the Gods
spell-temple_of_the_gods-desc = A consecrated hall materializes upon ground you designate, fitting within a vast open cube.
spell-incendiary_cloud = Incendiary Cloud
spell-incendiary_cloud-desc = A roiling cloud of soot and white-hot embers boils into being, searing everything caught within in a single scorching burst.
spell-mighty_fortress = Mighty Fortress
spell-mighty_fortress-desc = A vast keep of seamless stone heaves up from the chosen ground, its walls and towers raising in a single grinding instant.
spell-tsunami = Tsunami
spell-tsunami-desc = A towering wall of seawater erupts at a chosen point and collapses inward, hammering everything caught beneath its crushing weight.
spell-blade_of_disaster = Blade of Disaster
spell-blade_of_disaster-desc = You tear open a hovering shard of bladed void within range that slices through anything it touches. While it persists you can direct it to strike nearby foes.
spell-gate = Gate
spell-gate-desc = The caster tears open a brief rift in space and steps through it, reappearing at a chosen point within reach.
spell-storm_of_vengeance = Storm of Vengeance
spell-storm_of_vengeance-desc = You call down a towering vortex of raging weather that hammers everything beneath it with lashing winds, deafening thunder, and burning rain.
